    "name":  "RGB/RGBW Touch Wheel Remote Control RF 2.4GHz - 1 Zone - Ultra-thin - CR2032 - White",
    "reference":  "R8-1",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUltra-thin 1-zone remote for RGB and RGBW LED controllers\u003c/strong\u003e, with a sensitive \u003cstrong\u003etouch colour wheel\u003c/strong\u003e, direct \u003cstrong\u003eR / G / B / W\u003c/strong\u003e keys, brightness, dynamic modes and a scene key. RF 2.4GHz, up to 30 m range.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRuns on one CR2032 coin cell (about 1 year standby), wall holder included for screw or adhesive mounting.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eRGB/RGBW Touch Wheel Remote | RF 2.4GHz | 1 Zone\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eTouch colour wheel: touch to change the static RGB colour.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eR / G / B keys: short press for pure red, green or blue; long press 1-6 s to fine-tune each channel for millions of colours.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eW +/-: on RGB strips it mixes white from RGB (saturation); on RGBW strips it switches and dims the W channel.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBright +/-: 10 steps by short press, 256 levels by long press.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMode: next dynamic mode; long press 2 s to cycle all modes. Speed / Saturation key for speed (dynamic) or saturation (static).\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eScene: short press to recall, long press 2 s to save the current colour.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eOne remote can control one or more receivers; LED indicator shows each key press. The touch wheel sleeps after a few seconds to save the battery.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eTechnical data\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eOutput signal\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRF 2.4GHz\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eZones\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e1 zone (RGB / RGBW)\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003ePower supply\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e3VDC, 1 x CR2032 coin cell\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWorking current\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c5mA\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eStandby current\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c10μA\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eStandby time\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e1 year\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRemote distance\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e30 m (barrier-free space)\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eOperating temperature\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eTa -30 ~ +55ºC\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRemote size\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e107 x 58.5 x 9mm\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWall holder\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e63 x 68mm, screw or adhesive mounting\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003ePackage size\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e114 x 65 x 20mm\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eGross weight\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e0.062 kg\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eCertification\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eCE, RoHS, FCC, UL\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eColour\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWhite\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWarranty\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e5 years\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePairing\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWith the controller\u0027s MATCH key:\u003c/strong\u003e short press MATCH, then immediately press the on/off key on the remote; the controller\u0027s indicator flashes quickly when paired. Hold MATCH for 5 s to delete all paired remotes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBy power restart:\u003c/strong\u003e switch the power off and on twice, then immediately short press on/off 3 times to pair (light blinks 3 times), or 5 times to delete all remotes (light blinks 5 times).\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRGB + W together or separately:\u003c/strong\u003e on RGBW lights, hold on/off and W together for 2 s to choose whether the RGB colour and the white channel can be on at the same time (indicator blinks 4 times, factory default) or switch each other off (blinks twice).\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarning:\u003c/strong\u003e contains a coin battery - keep new and used batteries out of reach of children. Indoor, dry locations only.\u003c/p\u003e",
